---
description:
  Verifies that `style` directives applied to subgraph ids (fill, stroke-width,
  stroke, color) correctly style the subgraph's background and border, while
  nodes cross-link into and out of two separately styled subgraphs plus a node
  outside either.
config:
  fontFamily: courier
---
graph TB
  A
  B
  subgraph foo[Foo SubGraph]
  C
  D
  end
  subgraph bar[Bar SubGraph]
  E
  F
  end
  G

  A-->B
  B-->C
  C-->D
  B-->D
  D-->E
  E-->A
  E-->F
  F-->D
  F-->G
  B-->G
  G-->D

  style foo fill:#F99,stroke-width:2px,stroke:#F0F,color:darkred
  style bar fill:#999,stroke-width:10px,stroke:#0F0,color:blue
